Mr. Speaker, I am on the floor today to bring attention to an article from the World Affairs Journal titled, "Money Pit: The Monstrous Failure of USAID to Afghanistan." This is an eight-page article documenting case after case of American tax dollars being wasted in Afghanistan.

[[00:00:26.940]]
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER
I

[[00:00:27.340]]
