would like to bring one specific example to your attention, keeping in mind that many more months have now passed since this article was published, and these figures are now even larger. And I quote, "In a recent quarterly report, the United States Special Inspector General for Afghan Reconstruction said that when security for aid workers is figured,

[[00:00:50.530]]
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER
