traveled through the 3rd District of North Carolina last week, I spoke on this subject many times and was met with frustration from the audience at the waste of taxpayers' money in Afghanistan. When I went on to explain that the Afghan parliament was able to vote on the bilateral strategic agreement that we are in the process of finalizing with Afghanistan, but we have not even debated the issue in the House.

[[00:01:46.490]]
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER
The

[[00:01:46.560]]
