Speaker, I hope the leadership of both parties will allow this Congress to debate whether we should stay in Afghanistan for 10 more years. If the parliament in Afghanistan can have that debate, why can't the United States House of Representatives? In closing, I would like to ask God to please bless our men and women in uniform and their families. And I'll close by saying we have spent enough blood and treasure on this failed policy in Afghanistan.

[[00:03:57.420]]
